  else fib (n - 1) + fib (n - 2)
@end example

@enumerate a

@item
Give a formula in terms of @math{n} for the maximum depth of the stack required to
compute @math{{\hbox{Fib}(n)}} for @math{{n \ge 2}}.  Hint: In @ref{1.2.2} we
